<title>AAA Study: EVs Lose Significant Range When Hauling Heavy Cargo</title>
<meta name=robots content=index,follow>
<meta name=description lang=en-us content="MADISON, Wis., (June 21, 2023) – A new study from the AAA Automotive Engineering research team finds that electric vehicles (EVs) lose a significant amount of range when loaded with heavy cargo.

The study tested the Ford F-150 Lightning, a popular electric pickup truck, and found that its range dropped by 24.5% (from 278 miles to 210) when load...">
